# Baked into the production build (vite build). The SurrealDB endpoint and the
# sync node's URL are added by `spky deploy` itself.
#
# Use the app's origin for /api, /mcp and /material-assets in production:
# https://talktobolo.stg.spky.cloud. These paths must route to the API Worker.
# Set an absolute origin here only when hosting the API separately.
VITE_API_URL=
